<title>USA: Hopkins, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Hopkins, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc. said it won $2.240 million of Hopkins, Minn., general obligation tax increment bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.06 percent.</p>
</text>
